exports[`getOneRouteDriveBlockerMessage given: [case3] feedbackUnabsorbed with an absent taken when: [t0] the dispatcher runs with the feedbackUnabsorbed blocker then: matches snapshot — the held stop, as a driver reads it: stophook - held stop, reply owed 1`] = `
"🦉 the reviewers await your reply

🌕 lets respond
   │
   ├─ review.peer 1/1
   │  ├─ slug = arch
   │  ├─ status = retired from the guard config
   │  ├─ verdict = 2 blockers, 1 nitpick
   │  ├─ absorb from
   │  │  └─ .reviews/peer/1.vision._.review.i001.<hash>.r001._.given.by_peer.arch.md
   │  └─ articulate into
   │     └─ .reviews/peer/1.vision._.review.i001.<hash>.r001._.taken.by_self.arch.md
   │
   ├─ why a retired reviewer still awaits
   │  └─ it spoke, and was then removed from the guard config. what it said
   │     was never answered, and a debt is keyed to the reviewer rather than
   │     to the artifact, so no edit to the artifact can clear it.
   │
   ├─ what to do — answer the retired reviewer
   │  └─ answer it as you would any other — write the .taken above. it will
   │     not speak again, so your answer is what discharges it.
   │
   └─ when you've absorbed this reviewer, run
      └─ rhx route.stone.set --stone 1.vision --as absorbed --that arch"
`;

exports[`getOneRouteDriveBlockerMessage given: [case5] malpartitioned, and a changed file still sits in no partition when: [t0] the dispatcher runs with the malpartitioned blocker then: the bytes a driver reads are pinned 1`] = `
"🦉 the partitions would leave changed files unreviewed — no lane runs until they cover them

🗿 route.guard.partition, on stone 5.1.test
   └─ scope @all
      ├─ 1 changed file sits in no partition
      │  └─ src/route/drive/b.ts → route (+ src/route/drive/**)
      └─ repair — run this, then re-arrive
            rhx route.guard.partition --route .behavior/v2026_01_01.demo --for review --peer @all \\
              --claim 'src/route/drive/**' --into route \\
              --mode apply

✨ did you know?
   ├─ claim each domain whole, in every layer, and the files you edit next stay covered
   └─ e.g. src/route/** and blackbox/{,__snapshots__/}driver.route.* in one partition"
`;
